{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Independent non-author receipt for internal-chargeable-turtledove. Reviewed commit 7a253b8c439b9895242ce8d446f53b7d812f43db against immutable base d6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84 and commit parent. The exact eight-path census, immutable prose-only AST and directive oracle, comment hygiene, diff integrity, focused contract suite with 276 passing tests, clean worktree, DCO, Change-Id, and rebar ticket trailer all passed. The documented CLI architecture remains aligned with the unchanged runtime tree. Exactly 65 allowlisted blocks changed, every block is shorter, and no directive or executable byte changed. Word count fell from 4691 to 1747. Full local make verify remains intentionally deferred under the operator's documentation-only CI substitution.\n\nstable_id\tbefore_citation\tfinal_citation\tpreserved_contract_or_consumer\tdirectives_exact\tbefore_words\tfinal_words\treviewer_session\tsemantic_pass\tbloat_pass\nsrc/rebar/_cli/__init__.py::module-docstring\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:src/rebar/_cli/__init__.py:L1-L13\t7a253b8c439b9895242ce8d446f53b7d812f43db:src/rebar/_cli/__init__.py:L1-L6\tCLI maintainers: in-process tokenization, committed help data, registry dispatch, and per-command initialization ownership remain explicit.\tPASS\t75\t34\t/root:internal-chargeable-turtledove-independent-review\tPASS\tPASS\nsrc/rebar/_cli/__init__.py::module::comment(Registry route authority)\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:src/rebar/_cli/__init__.py:L24-L26\t7a253b8c439b9895242ce8d446f53b7d812f43db:src/rebar/_cli/__init__.py:L17-L17\tCLI architecture: the standard-library-only route registry remains the sole routing and runtime-policy authority.\tPASS\t40\t14\t/root:internal-chargeable-turtledove-independent-review\tPASS\tPASS\nsrc/rebar/_cli/__init__.py::module::comment(Store-mount exclusions)\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:src/rebar/_cli/__init__.py:L28-L32\t7a253b8c439b9895242ce8d446f53b7d812f43db:src/rebar/_cli/__init__.py:L19-L21\tCLI operators: init, scratch, and config validate remain outside central mounting, while other commands attach only an existing store.\tPASS\t62\t28\t/root:internal-chargeable-turtledove-independent-review\tPASS\tPASS\nsrc/rebar/_cli/__init__.py::module::comment(Pure-intercept mount coverage)\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:src/rebar/_cli/__init__.py:L34-L37\t7a253b8c439b9895242ce8d446f53b7d812f43db:src/rebar/_cli/__init__.py:L23-L24\tCLI maintainers: pure intercepts still cross the central mount boundary before any per-arm initialization.\tPASS\t35\t18\t/root:internal-chargeable-turtledove-independent-review\tPASS\tPASS\nsrc/rebar/_cli/__init__.py::_store_mount_eligible-docstring\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:src/rebar/_cli/__init__.py:L42-L52\t7a253b8c439b9895242ce8d446f53b7d812f43db:src/rebar/_cli/__init__.py:L29-L34\tCLI users: empty, storeless, help, config-validation, and unknown forms remain side-effect free, while strict arms retain greenfield handling.\tPASS\t103\t41\t/root:internal-chargeable-turtledove-independent-review\tPASS\tPASS\nsrc/rebar/_cli/__init__.py::_bridge_probe-docstring\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:src/rebar/_cli/__init__.py:L88-L104\t7a253b8c439b9895242ce8d446f53b7d812f43db:src/rebar/_cli/__init__.py:L70-L76\tBridge operators: the Jira capability probe skips tracker initialization, inherits output, applies setup environment overrides, and limits mutation to a throwaway issue.\tPASS\t124\t47\t/root:internal-chargeable-turtledove-independent-review\tPASS\tPASS\nsrc/rebar/_cli/__init__.py::_bridge_suggest_mapping-docstring\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:src/rebar/_cli/__init__.py:L115-L126\t7a253b8c439b9895242ce8d446f53b7d812f43db:src/rebar/_cli/__init__.py:L87-L93\tBridge operators and tests: mapping discovery remains read-only, stdout is the default, write mode preserves existing values, and the probe factory remains replaceable.\tPASS\t101\t57\t/root:internal-chargeable-turtledove-independent-review\tPASS\tPASS\nsrc/rebar/_cli/__init__.py::_suggest_mapping_write-docstring\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:src/rebar/_cli/__init__.py:L187-L192\t7a253b8c439b9895242ce8d446f53b7d812f43db:src/rebar/_cli/__init__.py:L154-L159\tConfig owners: suggestions target owned rebar.toml only, preserve existing project mappings and flat Jira or tracker siblings, and never edit pyproject.toml.\tPASS\t64\t38\t/root:internal-chargeable-turtledove-independent-review\tPASS\tPASS\nsrc/rebar/_cli/__init__.py::module::comment(Pre-extracted confirmation flags)\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:src/rebar/_cli/__init__.py:L290-L298\t7a253b8c439b9895242ce8d446f53b7d812f43db:src/rebar/_cli/__init__.py:L257-L259\tCLI consumers: global confirmation flags are extracted before positional dispatch while registry scopes preserve legacy output parsing and JSON bytes.\tPASS\t91\t25\t/root:internal-chargeable-turtledove-independent-review\tPASS\tPASS\nsrc/rebar/_cli/__init__.py::main::comment(Removed-input boundary)\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:src/rebar/_cli/__init__.py:L361-L364\t7a253b8c439b9895242ce8d446f53b7d812f43db:src/rebar/_cli/__init__.py:L322-L323\tCLI users: BaseException-derived removed inputs still produce the migration message and exit 1 without a traceback.\tPASS\t48\t19\t/root:internal-chargeable-turtledove-independent-review\tPASS\tPASS\nsrc/rebar/_cli/__init__.py::main::comment(Config-error boundary)\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:src/rebar/_cli/__init__.py:L375-L378\t7a253b8c439b9895242ce8d446f53b7d812f43db:src/rebar/_cli/__init__.py:L334-L334\tCLI users: invalid configuration still uses the clean exit-1 rendering shared with global override errors.\tPASS\t41\t13\t/root:internal-chargeable-turtledove-independent-review\tPASS\tPASS\nsrc/rebar/_cli/__init__.py::main::comment(Read-core exit ownership)\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:src/rebar/_cli/__init__.py:L382-L385\t7a253b8c439b9895242ce8d446f53b7d812f43db:src/rebar/_cli/__init__.py:L338-L339\tCLI users: residual TrackerRootError rendering and exit ownership remain at the CLI boundary.\tPASS\t51\t14\t/root:internal-chargeable-turtledove-independent-review\tPASS\tPASS\nsrc/rebar/_cli/__init__.py::_main_dispatch::comment(Help pre-scan before effects)\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:src/rebar/_cli/__init__.py:L395-L399\t7a253b8c439b9895242ce8d446f53b7d812f43db:src/rebar/_cli/__init__.py:L349-L350\tCLI users: overview, help, and unknown forms are served from committed artifacts before configuration, snapshots, mounts, handlers, or optional imports.\tPASS\t55\t21\t/root:internal-chargeable-turtledove-independent-review\tPASS\tPASS\nsrc/rebar/_cli/__init__.py::_main_dispatch::comment(Global config overrides)\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:src/rebar/_cli/__init__.py:L404-L407\t7a253b8c439b9895242ce8d446f53b7d812f43db:src/rebar/_cli/__init__.py:L355-L356\tCLI consumers: leading repeatable config overrides remain the highest-precedence layer for the entire invocation.\tPASS\t42\t17\t/root:internal-chargeable-turtledove-independent-review\tPASS\tPASS\nsrc/rebar/_cli/__init__.py::_main_dispatch::comment(One authoritative operation snapshot)\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:src/rebar/_cli/__init__.py:L427-L437\t7a253b8c439b9895242ce8d446f53b7d812f43db:src/rebar/_cli/__init__.py:L376-L379\tCLI architecture: one snapshot binds after overrides and before effects, prevents mid-operation retargeting, and preserves fail-open repair commands without weakening strict consumers.\tPASS\t130\t43\t/root:internal-chargeable-turtledove-independent-review\tPASS\tPASS\nsrc/rebar/_cli/__init__.py::_main_dispatch::comment(Central store-mount gate)\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:src/rebar/_cli/__init__.py:L441-L447\t7a253b8c439b9895242ce8d446f53b7d812f43db:src/rebar/_cli/__init__.py:L383-L385\tCLI architecture: the central gate attaches an existing store once for all dispatched commands, including intercepts, without first-store creation or reconvergence.\tPASS\t68\t32\t/root:internal-chargeable-turtledove-independent-review\tPASS\tPASS\nsrc/rebar/_cli/__init__.py::_main_dispatch::comment(Real-command dispatch after pre-scan)\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:src/rebar/_cli/__init__.py:L451-L455\t7a253b8c439b9895242ce8d446f53b7d812f43db:src/rebar/_cli/__init__.py:L389-L390\tCLI architecture: only command invocations reach the common registry executor after pure pre-scan forms return.\tPASS\t55\t15\t/root:internal-chargeable-turtledove-independent-review\tPASS\tPASS\nsrc/rebar/_cli/_help_route.py::module-docstring\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:src/rebar/_cli/_help_route.py:L1-L23\t7a253b8c439b9895242ce8d446f53b7d812f43db:src/rebar/_cli/_help_route.py:L1-L7\tCLI users: lexical pre-scan serves committed help, overview, and unknown output before stateful work, while nested help and commands continue to dispatch.\tPASS\t174\t53\t/root:internal-chargeable-turtledove-independent-review\tPASS\tPASS\nsrc/rebar/_cli/_help_route.py::module::comment(Nested help families)\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:src/rebar/_cli/_help_route.py:L33-L36\t7a253b8c439b9895242ce8d446f53b7d812f43db:src/rebar/_cli/_help_route.py:L17-L19\tCLI maintainers: bridge nesting derives from its parser factory, while intercept families and config validate stay explicit because pre-scan cannot derive them.\tPASS\t48\t25\t/root:internal-chargeable-turtledove-independent-review\tPASS\tPASS\nsrc/rebar/_cli/_help_route.py::wants_help-docstring\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:src/rebar/_cli/_help_route.py:L64-L70\t7a253b8c439b9895242ce8d446f53b7d812f43db:src/rebar/_cli/_help_route.py:L47-L51\tCLI users: help flags are recognized in any position before the double-dash terminator, which explicitly suppresses interception.\tPASS\t66\t19\t/root:internal-chargeable-turtledove-independent-review\tPASS\tPASS\nsrc/rebar/_cli/_help_route.py::help_requested-docstring\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:src/rebar/_cli/_help_route.py:L80-L85\t7a253b8c439b9895242ce8d446f53b7d812f43db:src/rebar/_cli/_help_route.py:L61-L65\tCLI users: nested families expose only leading family help at pre-scan, while ordinary commands recognize help anywhere before the terminator.\tPASS\t46\t24\t/root:internal-chargeable-turtledove-independent-review\tPASS\tPASS\nsrc/rebar/_cli/_help_route.py::_strip_config_prefix-docstring\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:src/rebar/_cli/_help_route.py:L112-L117\t7a253b8c439b9895242ce8d446f53b7d812f43db:src/rebar/_cli/_help_route.py:L92-L95\tCLI users: only well-formed leading overrides are skipped, and malformed prefixes fall through to the authoritative parser error.\tPASS\t45\t21\t/root:internal-chargeable-turtledove-independent-review\tPASS\tPASS\nsrc/rebar/_cli/_help_route.py::pre_scan-docstring\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:src/rebar/_cli/_help_route.py:L154-L159\t7a253b8c439b9895242ce8d446f53b7d812f43db:src/rebar/_cli/_help_route.py:L132-L136\tCLI users: pre-scan returns the served form's process code and leaves commands or nested child help to dispatch.\tPASS\t52\t24\t/root:internal-chargeable-turtledove-independent-review\tPASS\tPASS\nsrc/rebar/_cli/_init.py::module-docstring\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:src/rebar/_cli/_init.py:L1-L17\t7a253b8c439b9895242ce8d446f53b7d812f43db:src/rebar/_cli/_init.py:L1-L6\tCLI architecture: read arms own reconvergence, write and lifecycle arms reuse that path, and injected tracker overrides leave initialization and freshness to the caller.\tPASS\t113\t38\t/root:internal-chargeable-turtledove-independent-review\tPASS\tPASS\nsrc/rebar/_cli/_init.py::_create_tracker-docstring\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:src/rebar/_cli/_init.py:L55-L69\t7a253b8c439b9895242ce8d446f53b7d812f43db:src/rebar/_cli/_init.py:L44-L48\tTracker operators: linking to existing shared state remains automatic, while first-store creation retains the consent boundary.\tPASS\t124\t34\t/root:internal-chargeable-turtledove-independent-review\tPASS\tPASS\nsrc/rebar/_cli/_init.py::_create_tracker::comment(Auto-attach an existing tickets branch)\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:src/rebar/_cli/_init.py:L80-L83\t7a253b8c439b9895242ce8d446f53b7d812f43db:src/rebar/_cli/_init.py:L59-L60\tTracker operators: an existing local or remote tickets branch attaches automatically because it does not fabricate a new store.\tPASS\t47\t19\t/root:internal-chargeable-turtledove-independent-review\tPASS\tPASS\nsrc/rebar/_cli/_init.py::_confirm_and_init-docstring\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:src/rebar/_cli/_init.py:L107-L124\t7a253b8c439b9895242ce8d446f53b7d812f43db:src/rebar/_cli/_init.py:L84-L90\tTracker operators: interactive first-store creation may obtain consent, non-interactive callers must initialize explicitly, and repository mutations remain documented.\tPASS\t147\t45\t/root:internal-chargeable-turtledove-independent-review\tPASS\tPASS\nsrc/rebar/_cli/_init.py::ensure_initialized-docstring\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:src/rebar/_cli/_init.py:L152-L159\t7a253b8c439b9895242ce8d446f53b7d812f43db:src/rebar/_cli/_init.py:L118-L122\tCLI callers: strict initialization preserves first-store consent and automatic linkage to existing stores.\tPASS\t54\t24\t/root:internal-chargeable-turtledove-independent-review\tPASS\tPASS\nsrc/rebar/_cli/_init.py::ensure_initialized::comment(Use the configured tracker location)\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:src/rebar/_cli/_init.py:L168-L171\t7a253b8c439b9895242ce8d446f53b7d812f43db:src/rebar/_cli/_init.py:L131-L132\tTracker operators: existence checks use the configured tracker path so REBAR_ROOT outside Git's top level does not cause repeated prompts.\tPASS\t38\t20\t/root:internal-chargeable-turtledove-independent-review\tPASS\tPASS\nsrc/rebar/_cli/_init.py::ensure_store_mounted_best_effort-docstring\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:src/rebar/_cli/_init.py:L189-L212\t7a253b8c439b9895242ce8d446f53b7d812f43db:src/rebar/_cli/_init.py:L150-L156\tCLI architecture: best-effort mounting covers early intercepts, attaches only existing state, and never creates, reconverges, or raises.\tPASS\t188\t51\t/root:internal-chargeable-turtledove-independent-review\tPASS\tPASS\nsrc/rebar/_cli/_init.py::ensure_store_mounted_best_effort::comment(No-repo commands must not fail)\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:src/rebar/_cli/_init.py:L221-L223\t7a253b8c439b9895242ce8d446f53b7d812f43db:src/rebar/_cli/_init.py:L165-L166\tCLI users: REBAR_ROOT retains precedence and storeless commands remain usable outside a repository.\tPASS\t33\t15\t/root:internal-chargeable-turtledove-independent-review\tPASS\tPASS\nsrc/rebar/_cli/_jira_onboard.py::module-docstring\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:src/rebar/_cli/_jira_onboard.py:L1-L20\t7a253b8c439b9895242ce8d446f53b7d812f43db:src/rebar/_cli/_jira_onboard.py:L1-L7\tJira operators: non-secret settings retain environment-over-file precedence, missing values are prompted, owned config is persisted, tokens stay environment-only, and validation uses the subprocess-scoped probe.\tPASS\t157\t44\t/root:internal-chargeable-turtledove-independent-review\tPASS\tPASS\nsrc/rebar/_cli/_jira_onboard.py::_detect-docstring\td6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84:src/rebar/_cli/_jira_onboard.py:L43-L54\t7a253b8c439b9895242ce8d446f53b7d812f43db:src/rebar/_cli/_jira_onboard.py:L30-L35\tJira operators: detection remains best effort and environment-first, exposes only token presence, permits repair of malformed config, and leaves HTTPS enforcement on write and reconcile boundaries.\tPASS\t121\t41\t/root:internal-chargeable-turtledove-independent-review\tPASS\t